    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1561">

                <pb facs="0997" n="881" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg881"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.51/82.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Vice Consul Silliman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-07">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 7, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your August 5, 10 a.m. Department has most reliable information from two sources
                    Astruc and Giles were shot June 24th.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
